[2026-09-27T12:26:20.410+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "specification": "SignInInput is now { identifier: string; password: string } so the exact field name flows from the 'Username or email' input through SessionContext and the POST body to the service lookup (previously the field was named email). signIn() posts /auth/login through the shared axios instance (baseURL '/api'; REQ-1-1-1 contract requires withCredentials so the arc_session cookie round-trips) and resolves { user }. It must throw AuthRequestError carrying status 401 and the server's generic message for any credential rejection, and it must not surface which credential was wrong. fetchCurrentUser() GETs /auth/session, resolves null on 401 and throws on other failures so reload recovery works. signOut() POSTs /auth/logout. TODO(TDD): implement these bodies; they currently throw 'not implemented'.",
