[2026-09-27T12:26:20.410+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "specification": "Registered in backend/src/app.js via app.use('/api/auth', require('./routes/auth_routes')). Reused constants: SESSION_COOKIE_NAME = 'arc_session' (httpOnly, sameSite lax, path '/') and REGISTRATION_FIELDS. Additional contract this node owns: SIGN_IN_FIELDS = ['identifier','password'] (field name matches the 'Username or email' input and SignInInput) and INVALID_CREDENTIALS_MESSAGE = 'Invalid credentials'. POST /login accepts { identifier, password } where identifier may be a username or a verified email, resolves the account, validates the password and the account availability status, and on success answers 200 { user: { id, username, email, emailVerified }, session: { token } } and sets the arc_session cookie. Every credential failure — unknown username/email, incorrect password, unavailable account — answers the identical 401 { message: 'Invalid credentials' } (optionally with fieldErrors) and creates no session and no cookie. GET /session resolves the cookie via the service and answers 200 { user } or 401 { message }; POST /logout clears the cookie with 204. No response body or log line may contain the password or reveal which credential failed. TODO(TDD): replace the not-implemented handlers; the exported constants above still need to be added to the module exports.",
